      "value": "@{58c6cbcffd04b1785f747b6c|full_name}:  I mean the redistributable from microsoft downloads,  I opened the game and while it was running I went to the streaming folder and ran the youtubedownloader.exe file, It prompted an error message, something MVS100.dll or something. I searched it in google and read it was a Visual Studio 2010 file. I downloaded the redistributables and voila ...  it worked this time.\n\nI'm using windows 10 1803",
