      "statusChangeID": "5b60e6a978144b62d564f4ea",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "tracked",
      "value": "This is a known bug that Support is tracking. There are many causes. To be specific, this is related to VRC_SyncVideoPlayer (SyncVideoStream has its own class of bugs, primarily related to running older versions of Windows)\n\nCheck out http://help.vrchat.com/knowledge_base/topics/video-players-arent-working for some basic troubleshooting steps.\n\nCertificate check is unnecessary now, as the download application now ignores checking certificates.\n\nIf you have issues with this, please contact support@vrchat.com with your output logs. More information is necessary to help us track down this class of bugs.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
